0</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Godfrey Phillips Q2 profit down 37% to Rs 190 cr; revenue up twofold at Rs 4,198 cr]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Godfrey Phillips India Ltd reported a significant 37.73 percent decrease in net profit for the September quarter, primarily driven by a substantial tax increase from the previous fiscal year. Despite this, the company's total consolidated income surged to Rs 8,139.64 crore during the first half of FY27. To counteract the volumetric impact from rising taxes, a tactical pricing strategy was implemented.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/godfrey-phillips-q2-profit-down-37-to-rs-190-cr-revenue-up-twofold-at-rs-4198-cr/articleshow/135578939.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135578939,imgsize-57520.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/godfrey-phillips-q2-profit-down-37-to-rs-190-cr-revenue-up-twofold-at-rs-4198-cr/articleshow/135578939.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 21:09:02 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Glenmark Pharma Q2 Results: Net profit plunges 56% to Rs 264 crore, revenue down at Rs 4,247 cr]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Glenmark Pharmaceuticals experienced a 56.78 percent drop in consolidated profit after tax during the September quarter. Total revenue from operations decreased to Rs 4,247.32 crore compared to the previous year. The company's total expenses also decreased during the same period, indicating some operational efficiency. A subsidiary of Glenmark Pharma entered into a settlement for USD 15 million with Humana Inc.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/glenmark-pharma-q2-results-net-profit-plunges-56-to-rs-264-crore-revenue-down-at-rs-4247-cr/articleshow/135577516.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135577516,imgsize-27240.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/glenmark-pharma-q2-results-net-profit-plunges-56-to-rs-264-crore-revenue-down-at-rs-4247-cr/articleshow/135577516.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 20:08:54 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi revises currency derivative norms for domestic investors, FPIs; allows to trade up to USD 5 mn]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Sebi has revised its regulations to permit domestic and foreign portfolio investors to take positions in currency derivatives. Investors can now hold up to USD 5 million without establishing underlying exposure. The new guidelines also require FPIs to ensure their short positions do not exceed this limit. For amounts above the threshold, FPIs must have underlying exposure in Indian debt or equity securities.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-revises-currency-derivative-norms-for-domestic-investors-fpis-allows-to-trade-up-to-usd-5-mn/articleshow/135576552.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135576552,imgsize-78624.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-revises-currency-derivative-norms-for-domestic-investors-fpis-allows-to-trade-up-to-usd-5-mn/articleshow/135576552.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 19:33:58 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump's Loss, Wall Street's Gain? What Could Change for AI, Defence, Crypto and Elon Musk]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/trumps-loss-wall-streets-gain-what-could-change-for-ai-defence-crypto-and-elon-musk/videoshow/135575972.cms</link><enclosure type="video/wmv" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135575972,imgsize-301663.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/trumps-loss-wall-streets-gain-what-could-change-for-ai-defence-crypto-and-elon-musk/videoshow/135575972.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 19:10:36 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Marico among 10 stocks hitting 52-week highs; rally up to 14% in a month]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Ten BSE 100 stocks, including Marico, Adani Ports, Divis Laboratories and ICICI Bank, hit fresh 52-week highs on Thursday as benchmark indices staged a sharp rally.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/marico-among-10-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-rally-up-to-14-in-a-month/slideshow/135574817.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135574256,imgsize-12348.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/marico-among-10-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-rally-up-to-14-in-a-month/slideshow/135574817.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 18:14:24 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi approves net settlement of cash market trades for mutual funds]]> </title><description><![CDATA[India’s Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) has greenlit the introduction of net settlement for mutual fund schemes, set to take effect on April 1, 2027. This initiative is designed to streamline funding requirements and boost market efficiency. Previously, net settlement was exclusive to foreign portfolio investors. Eligible transactions will now be confined to sales or purchases of a specific security, while cross-scheme netting will remain prohibited.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-approves-net-settlement-of-cash-market-trades-for-mutual-funds/articleshow/135572968.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135572968,imgsize-99926.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-approves-net-settlement-of-cash-market-trades-for-mutual-funds/articleshow/135572968.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 17:41:45 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[11 smallcap stocks maintain over 10% profit margin in Q1 and Q2, shares rally 150-350% in FY27]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Eleven smallcap stocks have maintained net profit margins above 10% in both Q1 and Q2FY27, while delivering share price gains of 151% to 352% so far this fiscal year.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/11-smallcap-stocks-maintain-over-10-profit-margin-in-q1-and-q2-shares-rally-150-350-in-fy27/slideshow/135569927.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135569654,imgsize-13722.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/11-smallcap-stocks-maintain-over-10-profit-margin-in-q1-and-q2-shares-rally-150-350-in-fy27/slideshow/135569927.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:04:09 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[EPL Q2 Results: Profit rises 4% YoY to Rs 111 crore]]> </title><description><![CDATA[EPL reported a notable 4.52% increase in net profit, reaching Rs 110.9 crore for the September quarter of FY27. With revenues from operations climbing to Rs 1,567.4 crore, a 30% year-on-year growth, the Beauty &amp; Cosmetics and Oral Care segments played pivotal roles. Despite higher expenses, the EBITDA margins held strong above 20%. Looking forward, EPL is set to focus on sustained revenue growth and stable profit margins.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/epl-q2-results-profit-rises-4-yoy-to-rs-111-crore/articleshow/135565623.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135565623,imgsize-1871585.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/epl-q2-results-profit-rises-4-yoy-to-rs-111-crore/articleshow/135565623.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 14:02:12 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bharat Electronics among 5 stocks showing White Marubozu pattern]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Five Nifty 50 stocks featured in the W